    '“I understand how busy you must be; it sounds like a competent, dedicated, and efficient ________________ could be of some assistance. Perhaps I could call you back at a better time to discuss how I might make a',
  screenshot: 'out/B00J08H0QK/pages/page-068.png'
}
{
  index: 64,
