  text: 'out. The answers you give now should be geared toward getting you in the door and into a face-to-face meeting. (The serious issues of salary and salary negotiations are handled in the negotiation chapter.) For now, just know the main options are as follows:\n' +
    '• Direct answer: If you know the salary range for the position and there is a fit, give a straightforward answer.\n' +
