    'In other words, if you sport tats or piercings, conceal them during the interview and at all times during your professional endeavors. If you are considering body decoration, ask yourself if in the history of humankind there has ever been one item in any man or woman’s wardrobe that he or she',
  screenshot: 'out/B00J08H0QK/pages/page-087.png'
}
{
  index: 92,
