    'Men’s Raincoats\n' +
    'The safest and most utilitarian colors for raincoats are beige and blue; stick to these two exclusively. If you can avoid wearing a raincoat, do so (it’s an encumbrance and adds to clutter), but it is better to have a raincoat than to have your suit drenched.\n' +
