    '• Finally, make mention of one or two of the transferable skills and professional values that help you deliver on these crucial responsibilities: “So my multitasking, communication, and critical thinking skills help me do this every day ...”\n' +
    'Have you ever been asked to resign?\n' +
    'When someone is asked to resign, it is a gesture on the part of the employer: “You can quit, or we will can you, so which do you want it to be?” Because you were given the option, that employer cannot later say, “I had to ask him to resign,” since that is tantamount to firing and could lead to legal problems; that’s the point of the gesture. If you answer, “Yes,” it’s a mark against you and can derail your candidacy, so answer, “No.” If you are in',
  screenshot: 'out/B00J08H0QK/pages/page-154.png'
}
{
