    'Similarly to the prior question, behind this is an interest in your motivation to do the work being offered. The interviewer is looking for a fit between your dreams and her reality.\n' +
    'All worthwhile jobs require hard work and a desire to learn. Technology changes mean your job skills must always be in development if you want',
