  screenshot: 'out/B00J08H0QK/pages/page-161.png'
}
{
  index: 155,
  page: 156,
  text: 'Most managers will plump for the latter option. Taking responsibility and cleaning up the past really works and is the first step in putting yourself back on a success track.\n' +
    'How do you manage your work deadlines?\n' +
    'This examines the time-management and organization abilities that enable you to multitask productively. You should address the Prioritize, Do, Review cycle: You set time at the end of every day to review that day’s activities and plan tomorrow’s. You prioritize all the planned activities and stick to those priorities to make sure the important work is attended to first.\n' +
